{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_182C56D7","title":"For the Win","entry":"Dlg_182C56D7::entry","exit":"Dlg_182C56D7::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_7F480F40","articyId":"72057697117165814","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kenzy Voan","text":"Well, well, well… The person of the hour. This? This is what it’s all about. You earned your Lims and then some. And Zaffer? That Lappin lapper is the voice of a generation. I mean, fuck!!!!!","speakerId":"Ntt_08AA48D0","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, well, well… The person of the hour. This? This is what it’s all about. You earned your Lims and then some. And Zaffer? That Lappin lapper is the voice of a generation. I mean, fuck!!!!!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":-450.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19466","byteOffset":15249496,"byteLength":588}},{"id":"DFr_54288EE2","articyId":"72057697117165851","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kenzy Voan","text":"Happy to have it. Thanks for righting a wrong on this roller coaster of a timeline.","speakerId":"Ntt_08AA48D0","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Happy to have it. Thanks for righting a wrong on this roller coaster of a timeline.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":150.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23605","byteOffset":16808240,"byteLength":464}},{"id":"DFr_BDD77452","articyId":"72057697117166040","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kenzy Voan","text":"You say stuff like that and it makes me wanna keep you around.","speakerId":"Ntt_08AA48D0","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You say stuff like that and it makes me wanna keep you around.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":150.0,"y":-50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22245","byteOffset":16300792,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_D1B938AE","articyId":"72057697117166062","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kenzy Voan","text":"And Lims you shall get. Thanks for your help with this. If you're ever in the club come say hi. I'll keep an eye out.","speakerId":"Ntt_08AA48D0","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And Lims you shall get. Thanks for your help with this. If you're ever in the club come say hi. I'll keep an eye out.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":775.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50002","byteOffset":33259504,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_818639C6","articyId":"72057697117166116","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kenzy Voan","text":"It's funny, you know? We were so close you'd think when I breathed Finn's lungs would expand. But even if our organs had relied on one another, I don't think any of us ever felt more alone.","speakerId":"Ntt_08AA48D0","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's funny, you know? We were so close you'd think when I breathed Finn's lungs would expand. But even if our organs had relied on one another, I don't think any of us ever felt more alone.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":750.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25579","byteOffset":17561968,"byteLength":512}},{"id":"DFr_C7CC6E95","articyId":"72057697117166131","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kenzy Voan","text":"So we can get it right this time.","speakerId":"Ntt_08AA48D0","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So we can get it right this time.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1350.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41639","byteOffset":30080744,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_C6BCF529","articyId":"72057697117166138","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kenzy Voan","text":"If you’re ever in the club, make sure to say \"Hi\". Call it a premonition or just wishful thinking, but I’d bet a box of glow rings we run into each other in the Spire.","speakerId":"Ntt_08AA48D0","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If you’re ever in the club, make sure to say \"Hi\". Call it a premonition or just wishful thinking, but I’d bet a box of glow rings we run into each other in the Spire.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1350.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35472","byteOffset":25780272,"byteLength":480}},{"id":"DFr_5C3A5395","articyId":"72057697117166160","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kenzy Voan","text":"Thanks again for your help. See you at the Starlight Lounge.","speakerId":"Ntt_08AA48D0","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Thanks again for your help. See you at the Starlight Lounge.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1950.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33473","byteOffset":20547568,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_20C21E42","articyId":"72057697117166170","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kenzy Voan","text":"We'll see if yah got enough energy to keep up. Come dance with me later and I'll know you're serious.","speakerId":"Ntt_08AA48D0","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We'll see if yah got enough energy to keep up. Come dance with me later and I'll know you're serious.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":750.0,"y":-300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43561","byteOffset":30808408,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_3DD0D72B","articyId":"72057697117165819","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Happy to help.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Happy to help.","TextSheVersion":"Happy to help.","TextTheyVersion":"Happy to help."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":-150.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26048","byteOffset":17736248,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_BCFBE31B","articyId":"72057697117165827","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Anything for you.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Anything for you.","TextSheVersion":"Anything for you.","TextTheyVersion":"Anything for you."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":-150.0,"y":-50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"16717","byteOffset":14218992,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_BDC0ECEC","articyId":"72057697117165834","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I don't need Lims and then some. Lims and Lims will do.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I don't need Lims and then some. Lims and Lims will do.","TextSheVersion":"I don't need Lims and then some. Lims and Lims will do.","TextTheyVersion":"I don't need Lims and then some. Lims and Lims will do."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":-150.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets